{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04095","headline":"陈仓别陇州司户李维深 · 苏頲","name":"陈仓别陇州司户李维深","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"京国自携手，同途欣解颐。\n情言正的的，春物宛迟迟。\n忽背雕戎役，旋瞻获宝祠。\n蜀城余出守，吴岳尔归思。\n欢惬更伤此，眷殷殊念兹。\n扬麾北林径，跂石南涧湄。\n中作壶觞饯，回添道路悲。\n数花临磴日，百草覆田时。\n有美同人意，无爲行子辞。\n酣歌拔劒起，毋是答恩私。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏頲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04095.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04095","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}